{{TreePortrait|Inoch.jpg|Inoch}}
Followers of Auramancy look to Inoch, a pious priest who was turned into an Astra as a child and would later become Haje, the god of doors and seals. In his tradition an auramancer shields and strengthens the whole party and keeps its allies standing when the magic gets thick.

'''Auramancy''' is a utility [[Skill Trees|skill tree]]. It strengthens allies and weakens enemies with Inspired stacks, energy shields and magic immunity, and it brings teleports, cleanses and a buff steal. Its own damage is limited, so it is usually paired with trees that deal damage and heal.

